# Line endings
#
# Store every text file with LF in the repository, and check it out with LF,
# regardless of what the local editor writes. Added August 2026, after an
# editor rewrote the whole tree as CRLF and git read it as 1,894 changed
# lines across 14 files — which would have buried a real 81-line change and
# ruined `git blame` on those files.
#
# If this ever looks wrong again, `git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol` shows the real
# change underneath the noise.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never convert, never diff as text.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
